@startuml sequenceDiagram
title Login and Posts Fetching Sequence Diagram
header IT1901: Group 8 - Twitter Clone - Release 3

actor User as User order 1
boundary "JavaFX UI" as UI order 2
control "REST API" as API order 3
database "Database" as DB order 4

note right of API
Uses Hibernate ORM for
database interactions
end note

== Login ==

User -> UI: Inputs login credentials
UI -> API: POST /auth/login
API -> DB: Query user by username

alt User doesn't exist
    DB --> API: User not found
    API -> DB: Create new user with credentials
    DB --> API: New user created
else User exists
    DB --> API: Return user data
end

API -> API: Generate JWT token
API --> UI: HTTP 200: Return JWT token
UI -> UI: Save JWT token locally
UI -> User: Display temporarily empty feed

== Fetch Posts and Show Feed ==

UI -> API: GET /api/posts with JWT token
alt Invalid token
    API --> UI: HTTP 401: Unauthorized
    UI -> User: Display error message, log in again
else Valid token
    API -> DB: Fetch posts
    DB --> API: Return posts data
    API --> UI: HTTP 200: Return posts data
    UI -> User: Display posts in feed
end

@enduml
